"Artona II is one of the Triplanets, one of the two original Artonan worlds with the Mother."
"The Artonan biologist Honorable Ty-krol comes from Artona II."
"Human performing arts are catching on there; the Anesidoran Avowed Ballet has toured it."
"Visiting wizards there give children non-permanent body art, such as turtle designs."
"An S-rank Rabbit with Cook of the Moment works on Artona II as a chef."
"The Palace of Unbreaking, where Lute Velra works for the wizard Parethat-uur, is on Artona II."
"Daily calls from Artona II to Earth cost too much, so families pre-schedule them."
